# file-sync (iCloud Drive) conflict copies
# When the repo lives under ~/Documents, iCloud Drive resolves duplicate
# versions by appending " 2", " 3", … before the extension (e.g.
# "auth-form 2.tsx", "CHANGELOG 3.md"). Match that exact signature — a space +
# digit immediately before a known source extension — so real filenames that
# merely contain a digit (e.g. "chapter2.md", "Q1 2024.md") are never ignored.
* [2-9].ts
* [2-9].tsx
* [2-9].js
* [2-9].jsx
* [2-9].mjs
* [2-9].cjs
* [2-9].md
* [2-9].mdx
* [2-9].json
* [2-9].css
* [2-9].scss
.env*

# Production-validation output (schema snapshots, test-results, query-plans,
# privilege reports). Generated by scripts/validation/*; never committed.
/artifacts/
